flowchart LR
  browser[Customer / Staff / Admin] --> web[Next.js on Vercel]
  web -->|Sign in / refresh| auth[Supabase Auth]
  web -->|HTTPS + Bearer JWT| proxy[VM reverse proxy]
  proxy --> api[NestJS Docker API]
  api -->|Verify JWT| auth
  api -->|Prisma TLS| db[(Supabase PostgreSQL)]
  api -->|Upload / sign URL| storage[Supabase Storage]
  web -->|Image read policy| storage
